  (c) not represent that any Dependency is licensed under this License
      unless it is.

QPT maintains a list of Dependencies and their respective licenses in the
repository at DEPENDENCIES.md. You are responsible for independently verifying
the license terms of any Dependency you introduce in a Derivative Work.


